 skills/eol-readiness-advisor/SKILL.md    | 2 +-
 skills/eol-stakeholder-sequence/SKILL.md | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/skills/eol-process/SKILL.md b/skills/eol-process/SKILL.md
index 2fcf4a1..206c1a0 100644
--- a/skills/eol-process/SKILL.md
+++ b/skills/eol-process/SKILL.md
@@ -462,7 +462,7 @@ saying "Level 2" and pasting what you have.
